## User

Prove `length-append`.

## Type

proposition
```agda
length-append : ∀ {A : Set} (xs ys : List A) → length (xs ++ ys) ≡ length xs + length ys
```

## Term

```agda
length-append [] ys = refl
length-append (x ∷ xs) ys = cong suc (length-append xs ys)
```

